        "event_id": "lite_evt_00412",
        "explanation": "The doctor gave an executable bounded urology plan with red flags but closed without addressing the unresolved document/pathology thread.",
        "quote": "先这样执行，最简单也最安全"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00427",
        "explanation": "The family demonstrated receipt of the final urology plan and escalation thresholds.",
        "quote": "这样我就照这个盯着了"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "Closure was executable for the active ureteral-stone/urology episode and had caregiver teach-back, but it was premature for the full case contract because the scattered records were never privacy-safely reconciled and the possible colonoscopy pathology follow-up thread was not checked.",
