        }
      ],
      "completion": "partial",
      "explanation": "HO1 was triggered by external-system gaps and blurry papers. The doctor gave some practical materials instructions for urology, but did not build a concise cross-institution packet organized by problem/date, did not include colonoscopy/pathology status, and did not give privacy-redaction or external-records fallback steps.",
