        }
      ],
      "completion": "partial",
      "explanation": "HO2 was triggered near the end because symptom cause, stone passage, records, and follow-up uncertainties remained. The doctor provided a practical transition plan and red flags, but did not explicitly classify acceptable residual uncertainty versus unsafe-to-wait unresolved items across renal symptoms, external records, pathology follow-up, and diabetes context.",
