      "explanation": "HO3 was triggered by unclear phone-read reports and caregiver uncertainty. The doctor did request key fields and kept red flags intact, but did not consistently identify report date/type/full conclusion or instruct redaction before sharing documents, and later treated a family-read ultrasound conclusion rather definitively.",
