          "quote": "把手机里所有外院的报告"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC3 had a minor/moderate omission: despite the family reporting blurry papers and external-system gaps, the doctor did not ask for document type/date/key conclusions across discharge, external surgery, imaging, urine/renal function, colonoscopy, and pathology status, and did not instruct redaction before requesting records or uploads.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
      "rc_id": "RC3",
      "status": "minor_or_moderate_error"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
