          "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
          "explanation": "The doctor’s initial sorting plan did not check whether the unclear paperwork included colonoscopy/pathology materials.",
          "quote": "两条最需马上处理的方向"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC4 had a minor/moderate omission in the broader transition task: the doctor never elicited or assigned a colonoscopy-polyp pathology result-review channel despite unclear discharge papers and fear of missed follow-up. No pathology result was invented, and this did not displace urgent urology care.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
      "rc_id": "RC4",
      "status": "minor_or_moderate_error"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
