          "quote": "固定每晚1粒"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00150",
          "explanation": "The doctor advised monitoring and emergency thresholds while awaiting follow-up.",
          "quote": "日测体温2次"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC5 was met: the doctor clarified current medicines as read from the pharmacy bag, avoided antibiotics, distinguished scheduled versus PRN pain/spasm medicines, and set home monitoring boundaries.",
