      "explanation": "RC7 was met overall: the doctor generally maintained diagnostic uncertainty early and used offline emergency/urology evaluation for confirmation. Some later language was more definitive than ideal, but it followed reported ED/imaging findings and did not rise to an in-chain overreach error.",
